flowchart TB
    Android[Android OS] --> Role[Browser role / default app]
    Android --> Permissions[Android runtime permissions]
    Android --> Intents[HTTP/HTTPS intents]
    Role --> System[System settings interface]
    Intents --> Handler[PHNX IntentHandler]
    Handler --> URL[UrlIntentParser]
    URL --> External[ExternalLinkHandler]
    External --> Profile[Selected profile]
    Profile --> Network[Network configuration]
    Profile --> Privacy[Privacy and website permissions]
    Profile --> Lifecycle[Lifecycle manager]
    Permissions --> Manager[PermissionManager]
    Manager --> Website[WebsitePermissionManager]
    Manager --> App[AndroidPermissionManager]
    Handler --> Chromium[Chromium browser engine]
    Website --> Chromium

